[[file:Secret Room Door.png]]

{{r|Secret Room}}s are rooms that are not normally visible on the map and are usually accessed by bombing a wall leading to them. Regular Secret Rooms are usually located next to 3 or 4 rooms, while {{r|Super Secret Room}}<b>s</b> can only be next to one room; they are placed on one of the dead ends generated on the map, similar to other Special Rooms. Very rarely, the regular '''Secret Room''' may also be located next to only one room. Entrances to Secret Rooms will never have rocks or gaps in the way. Secret Rooms usually contain at least one {{e|Shopkeeper}} and various pickups. Items found in Secret Rooms are from the {{ip|Secret Room|text=Secret Room item pool}}.

Unlike the Flash version of the game, Secret Rooms stay open after bombing them.

== Layouts ==
The following room maps were made using [https://github.com/Basement-Renovator/basement-renovator Basement Renovator] for cleaner viewing; note that all [[Urn]]s you see will be [[Mushroom]]s when encountered in-game.

